(6131143, 902802, 69325, '<td valign="top">nice, when harsh light works prefectly ;)</td>', 'nice, when harsh light works prefectly ;)', '2010-08-16 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131146, 903465, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light one of the few as I am making my intinal run through the thumbnails that jumped off the page at me!</td>', 'Very nice use of light one of the few as I am making my intinal run through the thumbnails that jumped off the page at me!', '2010-08-16 01:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131149, 903514, 83313, '<td valign="top">But does it work when you flip the switch? Looks like a cheap FM modulator for an MP3 player over there on the right.</td>', 'But does it work when you flip the switch? Looks like a cheap FM modulator for an MP3 player over there on the right.', '2010-08-16 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131151, 903230, 69325, '<td valign="top">LOL! guess I wasn''t the only one inspired by his work, i think you pulled off yours better!</td>', 'LOL! guess I wasn''t the only one inspired by his work, i think you pulled off yours better!', '2010-08-16 01:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131190, 903227, 58785, '<td valign="top">Imagination at work</td>', 'Imagination at work', '2010-08-16 02:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131233, 902926, 114285, '<td valign="top">Now this is a true still life photo, very nice composition, should rate well. 9</td>', 'Now this is a true still life photo, very nice composition, should rate well. 9', '2010-08-16 03:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131243, 903227, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wonderful creativity.  Super cool image.</td>', 'Wonderful creativity.  Super cool image.', '2010-08-16 03:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131267, 903692, 103032, '<td valign="top">Didn''t enter this challenge, still have no idea what still life is.  But this image is very pleasing in my eyes.  I like your creativity in using the mirror to create three pears; like that you have three books.  I like how your arrangement leads my eyes from the lower left to the peak of the mirror, then back down to the pear on the right.  I think your lighting is good too in giving nice play of light and shadows.  Finally I like the different textures throughout the image.  Nice still life.</td>', 'Didn''t enter this challenge, still have no idea what still life is.  But this image is very pleasing in my eyes.  I like your creativity in using the mirror to create three pears; like that you have three books.  I like how your arrangement leads my eyes from the lower left to the peak of the mirror, then back down to the pear on the right.  I think your lighting is good too in giving nice play of light and shadows.  Finally I like the different textures throughout the image.  Nice still life.', '2010-08-16 03:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131287, 903309, 40391, '<td valign="top">I hope your banana shot does better than mine is doing in the Under challenge :-)<br/> <br/>Nice effects with the lighting and contrasts</td>', 'I hope your banana shot does better than mine is doing in the Under challenge :-) Nice effects with the lighting and contrasts', '2010-08-16 05:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131295, 903593, 103032, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and shadows in this image.  Also like how the reflection has the back lighting.</td>', 'I really like the light and shadows in this image.  Also like how the reflection has the back lighting.', '2010-08-16 06:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131302, 903188, 17153, '<td valign="top">the front part is not in focus, you should have used larger F stop (smaller aperture), also you could increase the contrast a bit.</td>', 'the front part is not in focus, you should have used larger F stop (smaller aperture), also you could increase the contrast a bit.', '2010-08-16 07:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131307, 903043, 164, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the skull. Doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'Not sure about the skull. Doesn''t seem to fit.', '2010-08-16 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131317, 903601, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good control of your light - I particularly like the way it manages to bring out the texture of the glass, no mean feat! In terms of composition, I would have preferred a centimetere and a half (about 3/4") chopped from the bottom, and on a really pernickity note, I would prefer the background/base join to be more blended on the right hand side. All in all, though, very good work.</td>', 'Good control of your light - I particularly like the way it manages to bring out the texture of the glass, no mean feat! In terms of composition, I would have preferred a centimetere and a half (about 3/4") chopped from the bottom, and on a really pernickity note, I would prefer the background/base join to be more blended on the right hand side. All in all, though, very good work.', '2010-08-16 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131319, 903398, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - simple, effective.  The lighting, with the narrow band picking out the grooves works very well.</td>', 'I like this a lot - simple, effective.  The lighting, with the narrow band picking out the grooves works very well.', '2010-08-16 08:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131321, 903778, 17153, '<td valign="top">i think landscape format would be better here, and the background is too much sharpened. otherwise a classic composition, looks good.</td>', 'i think landscape format would be better here, and the background is too much sharpened. otherwise a classic composition, looks good.', '2010-08-16 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131324, 903227, 100393, '<td valign="top">My only ten. I gave no nines.<br/> <br/>For me, the Blue by some distance.</td>', 'My only ten. I gave no nines. For me, the Blue by some distance.', '2010-08-16 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131330, 903503, 17153, '<td valign="top">the hand says 2... the background is too distractive, because you can''t decide whether it''s a subject in the image or just a background. 4</td>', 'the hand says 2... the background is too distractive, because you can''t decide whether it''s a subject in the image or just a background. 4', '2010-08-16 08:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131332, 902540, 17153, '<td valign="top">good detail in the statue, but light trails are not ok for still life (light painting is on the other hand)</td>', 'good detail in the statue, but light trails are not ok for still life (light painting is on the other hand)', '2010-08-16 08:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131335, 903200, 17153, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but not well shot - for still life you need sharp focus (using a tripod is usually a must) and well distributed light.</td>', 'interesting idea, but not well shot - for still life you need sharp focus (using a tripod is usually a must) and well distributed light.', '2010-08-16 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131343, 903534, 17153, '<td valign="top">the cloth on the left is distracting, and I would prefer to see the whole statue in the photo. light is very good, congratulations!</td>', 'the cloth on the left is distracting, and I would prefer to see the whole statue in the photo. light is very good, congratulations!', '2010-08-16 08:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131345, 903519, 17153, '<td valign="top">the duotone color is not very pleasing. I''m seeing it in some kind of violet, and appears too cold. otherwise a good symmetry - good idea with the paper in the glasses!</td>', 'the duotone color is not very pleasing. I''m seeing it in some kind of violet, and appears too cold. otherwise a good symmetry - good idea with the paper in the glasses!', '2010-08-16 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131360, 903659, 17153, '<td valign="top">the crop is too tight, especially on the top, a wider space around and little more contrast would work here. nice reflection!</td>', 'the crop is too tight, especially on the top, a wider space around and little more contrast would work here. nice reflection!', '2010-08-16 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131361, 903230, 17153, '<td valign="top">good one! unfulfilled love maybe?</td>', 'good one! unfulfilled love maybe?', '2010-08-16 09:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131363, 903763, 17153, '<td valign="top">too much processed and too busy background</td>', 'too much processed and too busy background', '2010-08-16 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131364, 903593, 17153, '<td valign="top">nice light!</td>', 'nice light!', '2010-08-16 09:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131365, 903254, 17153, '<td valign="top">great hdr work! though i can''t decide if the table cloth is ok or would be better if it was something plain...</td>', 'great hdr work! though i can''t decide if the table cloth is ok or would be better if it was something plain...', '2010-08-16 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131368, 903393, 17153, '<td valign="top">good idea! i would love to see the flowers progressively wilting, but i guess one week is not enough for that.</td>', 'good idea! i would love to see the flowers progressively wilting, but i guess one week is not enough for that.', '2010-08-16 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131380, 903598, 17153, '<td valign="top">very classic, i love the detail in the cloth</td>', 'very classic, i love the detail in the cloth', '2010-08-16 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131381, 903486, 17153, '<td valign="top">this one definitely won''t be received well by the voters, since it is far from the classic "fruit on the table" style of still life, however the light and careful positioning of the bucket indicates that thought is put in arranging this photograph and it is far from an ordinary snapshot. i''m not sure about the fence though, but it adds balance to composition, so it''s good that you kept it in. almost dismissed this one too soon!</td>', 'this one definitely won''t be received well by the voters, since it is far from the classic "fruit on the table" style of still life, however the light and careful positioning of the bucket indicates that thought is put in arranging this photograph and it is far from an ordinary snapshot. i''m not sure about the fence though, but it adds balance to composition, so it''s good that you kept it in. almost dismissed this one too soon!', '2010-08-16 09:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131382, 903227, 17153, '<td valign="top">the pear is fantastic, but the background is too distracting and diverts attention away.</td>', 'the pear is fantastic, but the background is too distracting and diverts attention away.', '2010-08-16 09:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131420, 903630, 43774, '<td valign="top">The arrangement is nice. The front vase seems to be a bit soft, not sure if it''s out of focus or if it''s the glare from the lights.</td>', 'The arrangement is nice. The front vase seems to be a bit soft, not sure if it''s out of focus or if it''s the glare from the lights.', '2010-08-16 10:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131422, 903098, 43774, '<td valign="top">Arrangement is nice, I like the folds of the cloth on the bottom but not the wrinkles in it on the back.</td>', 'Arrangement is nice, I like the folds of the cloth on the bottom but not the wrinkles in it on the back.', '2010-08-16 10:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131424, 903519, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2010-08-16 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131425, 903577, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement but looks a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Nice arrangement but looks a bit flat to me.', '2010-08-16 10:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131427, 903561, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.', '2010-08-16 10:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131428, 903118, 43774, '<td valign="top">You need a bit more DOF so the pears and knife are also in focus. It''s a good arrangement.</td>', 'You need a bit more DOF so the pears and knife are also in focus. It''s a good arrangement.', '2010-08-16 10:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131429, 903601, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2010-08-16 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131431, 903621, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is quite unique and interesting.</td>', 'This is quite unique and interesting.', '2010-08-16 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131432, 903692, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2010-08-16 10:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
