(6131458, 902631, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like everything except the gloves holding the pot.....it looks too cheesy to me! Sorry, but I think it ruins the whole feel of the photo. Everything else is really nice.</td>', 'I like everything except the gloves holding the pot.....it looks too cheesy to me! Sorry, but I think it ruins the whole feel of the photo. Everything else is really nice.', '2010-08-16 10:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131459, 903465, 43774, '<td valign="top">Different and interesting!</td>', 'Different and interesting!', '2010-08-16 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131475, 902926, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like your tones in this, but to me it is just a bit over cluttered...Personally I like simplistic still life pictures...mind you I''m not saying this is bad...in comparison to the other...you at least got the general idea</td>', 'I really like your tones in this, but to me it is just a bit over cluttered...Personally I like simplistic still life pictures...mind you I''m not saying this is bad...in comparison to the other...you at least got the general idea', '2010-08-16 10:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131504, 903703, 87808, '<td valign="top">your horizon is perfect, well done</td>', 'your horizon is perfect, well done', '2010-08-16 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131513, 903227, 62895, '<td valign="top">This looks really cool. It''s one of my favorites in the challenge for sure. The backdrop surface is cool too. Good luck! (not voting, but adding to favs. :-)</td>', 'This looks really cool. It''s one of my favorites in the challenge for sure. The backdrop surface is cool too. Good luck! (not voting, but adding to favs. :-)', '2010-08-16 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131541, 903525, 50864, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white photo.  Probably getting killed in this challenge but still nice.</td>', 'Nice black and white photo.  Probably getting killed in this challenge but still nice.', '2010-08-16 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131561, 902802, 104009, '<td valign="top">very clever and original.  i would penalize for flowers generally as it''s overdone but this is refreshing.  8</td>', 'very clever and original.  i would penalize for flowers generally as it''s overdone but this is refreshing.  8', '2010-08-16 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131562, 903780, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good tonal range of white through to black, and an interesting but not confusing range of textures.  I broadly like the composition, but do feel that there are areas that could be improved - the frame is filled, giving a fairly rectangualr feel to the composition; I wonder if a triangle towards the top, perhaps through differing heights of bottles/jug, might give a more dynamic feel.  The diagonal placement of the chopping board and rolling pin work well.  I would like to see what it would look like with the bowl of eggs placed to the right - as it is, they are the first thing I see, and then my eyes wander across the frame to the bowl and scoop which, whilst important to the ''story'', are nothing like as aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'A good tonal range of white through to black, and an interesting but not confusing range of textures.  I broadly like the composition, but do feel that there are areas that could be improved - the frame is filled, giving a fairly rectangualr feel to the composition; I wonder if a triangle towards the top, perhaps through differing heights of bottles/jug, might give a more dynamic feel.  The diagonal placement of the chopping board and rolling pin work well.  I would like to see what it would look like with the bowl of eggs placed to the right - as it is, they are the first thing I see, and then my eyes wander across the frame to the bowl and scoop which, whilst important to the ''story'', are nothing like as aesthetically pleasing.', '2010-08-16 12:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131563, 903703, 58785, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Image has some flaws. I am not sure about the composition either :(</td>', 'Nice idea. Image has some flaws. I am not sure about the composition either :(', '2010-08-16 12:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
