(6131795, 903760, 104009, '<td valign="top">is walter from the story mrs. wiggs?   why does walter have girls shoes?   come to think of it why does walter have a feminine frock?  interesting title maybe walter isn''t the bear?  nice lighting and i kind of like the trailing off background....7 <br/>ETA:  ok i looked up mrs. wiggs out of curiosity.  how incongruous with the bear!  but after looking at this image even more, I see the story you''re shooting for is the little girl''s toys?</td>', 'is walter from the story mrs. wiggs?   why does walter have girls shoes?   come to think of it why does walter have a feminine frock?  interesting title maybe walter isn''t the bear?  nice lighting and i kind of like the trailing off background....7 ETA:  ok i looked up mrs. wiggs out of curiosity.  how incongruous with the bear!  but after looking at this image even more, I see the story you''re shooting for is the little girl''s toys?', '2010-08-16 15:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131796, 903213, 104009, '<td valign="top">refractions and wine glasses are so overdone on this site it''s ridiculous but this is at least a very pleasing image and great technicals 6 <br/> <br/>ETA i need to bump this shot a notch to 7 it is much more well done than i gave it credit for previously even if it is overdone.</td>', 'refractions and wine glasses are so overdone on this site it''s ridiculous but this is at least a very pleasing image and great technicals 6  ETA i need to bump this shot a notch to 7 it is much more well done than i gave it credit for previously even if it is overdone.', '2010-08-16 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131797, 903590, 104009, '<td valign="top">interesting subject and setup with the old photo included.  also...is it sitting on a map?  nice lighting 7</td>', 'interesting subject and setup with the old photo included.  also...is it sitting on a map?  nice lighting 7', '2010-08-16 15:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131798, 903703, 104009, '<td valign="top">ok first of all great concept and nice execution of a setup.  however the lighting on the oreos that are stacked looks a little blown out and it distracts my eye....7 but would have been a point or two higher with better lighting/processing on the oreos</td>', 'ok first of all great concept and nice execution of a setup.  however the lighting on the oreos that are stacked looks a little blown out and it distracts my eye....7 but would have been a point or two higher with better lighting/processing on the oreos', '2010-08-16 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131799, 903550, 104009, '<td valign="top">interesting and almost minimalist...i admit spending a few seconds tring to figure out the writing to see if it was significant, apparently not :)  nice job 7</td>', 'interesting and almost minimalist...i admit spending a few seconds tring to figure out the writing to see if it was significant, apparently not :)  nice job 7', '2010-08-16 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6131802, 903561, 104009, '<td valign="top">i don''t know i guess it''s a standard but for some reason the coffee cup ruins this shot for me it''s just so incongruous what excellent technicals though great lighting 7  <br/> <br/>ETA ruins is the wrong word, i apologize i still love it enough for a 7 just...the coffee cup immediately catches my eye and i think "what is it doing there"?</td>', 'i don''t know i guess it''s a standard but for some reason the coffee cup ruins this shot for me it''s just so incongruous what excellent technicals though great lighting 7   ETA ruins is the wrong word, i apologize i still love it enough for a 7 just...the coffee cup immediately catches my eye and i think "what is it doing there"?', '2010-08-16 15:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
