(6131872, 903476, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the bg lighting, but think there is too much negative space.  Perhaps less of it on the right would make the left give the aura or impression of possibilities, but as it is, it''s a bit much for me.</td>', 'I like the bg lighting, but think there is too much negative space.  Perhaps less of it on the right would make the left give the aura or impression of possibilities, but as it is, it''s a bit much for me.', '2010-08-16 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
