(6131898, 903575, 62895, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image. The vine spheres look very good in B&amp;W. I can see vague outlines of corners in the background that are mildly distracting, but overall this is very well executed. (no vote)</td>', 'Nice clean image. The vine spheres look very good in B&W. I can see vague outlines of corners in the background that are mildly distracting, but overall this is very well executed. (no vote)', '2010-08-16 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
