(6132111, 903598, 98339, '<td valign="top">really do like this alot...my only 2 cents is to have added more elevation to the jar and pitcher making your focal point stagger/displayed...just a little...(bear in mind that isn''t hurting your score)</td>', 'really do like this alot...my only 2 cents is to have added more elevation to the jar and pitcher making your focal point stagger/displayed...just a little...(bear in mind that isn''t hurting your score)', '2010-08-16 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132143, 903633, 104009, '<td valign="top">interesting title no idea what it means what are they sitting in?  nice lighting 6<br/> <br/>ETA  thanks for explaining!  now the story means that much more.  still wonder what they''re standing in though!  looks like a bunny face at the young lady''s feet....</td>', 'interesting title no idea what it means what are they sitting in?  nice lighting 6 ETA  thanks for explaining!  now the story means that much more.  still wonder what they''re standing in though!  looks like a bunny face at the young lady''s feet....', '2010-08-16 19:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132153, 903569, 104009, '<td valign="top">wrote about two paragraph comment on this one but looks like it didnt take so here i go again (whitesnake?) ok the theme is over played with fruit on porcelain and flowers but the setup and execution here is excellent.  not sure whats in front of the plate looks like mushrooms?  and (i know this is nitpicking) the reflection of the vase in the knife is distracting.  eggplant was a great unique choice credit for that 7</td>', 'wrote about two paragraph comment on this one but looks like it didnt take so here i go again (whitesnake?) ok the theme is over played with fruit on porcelain and flowers but the setup and execution here is excellent.  not sure whats in front of the plate looks like mushrooms?  and (i know this is nitpicking) the reflection of the vase in the knife is distracting.  eggplant was a great unique choice credit for that 7', '2010-08-16 19:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132156, 903228, 104009, '<td valign="top">interesting ....going for the illusion of movement in a still life photo/challenge i like the rebelliousness of it not too crazy about the photo could have maybe added a little blur to give it more of an abstract feel 6</td>', 'interesting ....going for the illusion of movement in a still life photo/challenge i like the rebelliousness of it not too crazy about the photo could have maybe added a little blur to give it more of an abstract feel 6', '2010-08-16 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132158, 903747, 104009, '<td valign="top">great bokeh i like the different choice of subject 7</td>', 'great bokeh i like the different choice of subject 7', '2010-08-16 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132160, 903642, 104009, '<td valign="top">not crazy about the cliched choice of subject matter and the missed focus on the grapes hurts the image also.  the baby''s breath looks a little fuzzy as well.  nice lighting though 6</td>', 'not crazy about the cliched choice of subject matter and the missed focus on the grapes hurts the image also.  the baby''s breath looks a little fuzzy as well.  nice lighting though 6', '2010-08-16 19:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
