(6132849, 903621, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey! Grog not <b>THAT</b> old! <br/> <br/>Fish good when mammoth hunt is bad. Much better than Thag''s tree bark casserole. Females and younglings can catch fish, too. Very safe. (Safe for females and younglings, but not for fish.)</td>', 'Hey! Grog not THAT old!  Fish good when mammoth hunt is bad. Much better than Thag''s tree bark casserole. Females and younglings can catch fish, too. Very safe. (Safe for females and younglings, but not for fish.)', '2010-08-17 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132850, 902685, 83313, '<td valign="top">Extra pointage for an honest title.</td>', 'Extra pointage for an honest title.', '2010-08-17 14:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132852, 903525, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really do like the moodiness of this and the story implied, but how is this a still life? Gonna have to give you the schizophrenic combo of a low vote and a fave.</td>', 'I really do like the moodiness of this and the story implied, but how is this a still life? Gonna have to give you the schizophrenic combo of a low vote and a fave.', '2010-08-17 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132855, 903462, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of an odd assortment of items, but it got my attention. What is that in the back? Almost looks like a fill valve for a toilet. Extra pointage for making me pause to examine it more carefully.</td>', 'Kind of an odd assortment of items, but it got my attention. What is that in the back? Almost looks like a fill valve for a toilet. Extra pointage for making me pause to examine it more carefully.', '2010-08-17 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
