(6132874, 903787, 62895, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and sharpness. Not your typical still life, I''m guessing that may hurt your score a bit. (no vote)</td>', 'Good clarity and sharpness. Not your typical still life, I''m guessing that may hurt your score a bit. (no vote)', '2010-08-17 14:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132876, 903594, 62895, '<td valign="top">I like the textures you''ve put together here. For me, the backdrop seems a bit boring. I''m not sure what would work better, possible something that doesn''t blend in with the subject as much.</td>', 'I like the textures you''ve put together here. For me, the backdrop seems a bit boring. I''m not sure what would work better, possible something that doesn''t blend in with the subject as much.', '2010-08-17 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132878, 903103, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good DOF. I like the minimal grain.</td>', 'Nice shot and good DOF. I like the minimal grain.', '2010-08-17 14:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132881, 903776, 69368, '<td valign="top">this is really interesting. perfect composition of subjects. nice lighting. looks like an art work!</td>', 'this is really interesting. perfect composition of subjects. nice lighting. looks like an art work!', '2010-08-17 15:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132884, 903720, 62895, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity on the rose, and the bokeh is nice too. I''m not sure if this would be classified as still life or not. It seems more like a portrait of a flower, typically still life is an arrangement of various inanimate objects. Still a nice shot though. Good luck! :-) (no vote)</td>', 'I like the clarity on the rose, and the bokeh is nice too. I''m not sure if this would be classified as still life or not. It seems more like a portrait of a flower, typically still life is an arrangement of various inanimate objects. Still a nice shot though. Good luck! :-) (no vote)', '2010-08-17 15:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132886, 902689, 69368, '<td valign="top">hmmm... it''s not really a still life in my eyes</td>', 'hmmm... it''s not really a still life in my eyes', '2010-08-17 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132887, 903778, 62895, '<td valign="top">I like your arrangement, you have a good eye. I think this could have been taken to another level with some lighting to the front to add some nice catch-lights on the bottle and cherries. (no vote)</td>', 'I like your arrangement, you have a good eye. I think this could have been taken to another level with some lighting to the front to add some nice catch-lights on the bottle and cherries. (no vote)', '2010-08-17 15:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132892, 903251, 62895, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the concept you''re trying to convey is. On a technical note, I think the lighting could be improved. I think some lighting from behind the setup would help to bring out the wine glass from the background, also the ball on the left blends into the background in its right side.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the concept you''re trying to convey is. On a technical note, I think the lighting could be improved. I think some lighting from behind the setup would help to bring out the wine glass from the background, also the ball on the left blends into the background in its right side.', '2010-08-17 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6132961, 903413, 39412, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot.', '2010-08-17 16:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133009, 903772, 104009, '<td valign="top">the noise!  the noise!  cute concept even if the execution is a little off the double shadows the noise...still...i like different.  6</td>', 'the noise!  the noise!  cute concept even if the execution is a little off the double shadows the noise...still...i like different.  6', '2010-08-17 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133012, 903723, 104009, '<td valign="top">oh brother wrote a huge paragraph for this image and it didn''t take.  let me try again, i like the busy nature of this image it makes me keep looking for more i might have missed, the overgrown fence the blurred edges look a little off i like the contrast off the fence and it''s surroundings 7</td>', 'oh brother wrote a huge paragraph for this image and it didn''t take.  let me try again, i like the busy nature of this image it makes me keep looking for more i might have missed, the overgrown fence the blurred edges look a little off i like the contrast off the fence and it''s surroundings 7', '2010-08-17 17:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133013, 903598, 104009, '<td valign="top">i understand the tribue shot and you''ve recreated the classic look quite well excellent lighting and composition.  7</td>', 'i understand the tribue shot and you''ve recreated the classic look quite well excellent lighting and composition.  7', '2010-08-17 17:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133014, 903780, 104009, '<td valign="top">excellent diversion from all the fruits and flowers and wine glasses!  how refreshing and different and cohesive i like a lot about this shot well lit well composed  8</td>', 'excellent diversion from all the fruits and flowers and wine glasses!  how refreshing and different and cohesive i like a lot about this shot well lit well composed  8', '2010-08-17 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
