(6136647, 903226, 104009, '<td valign="top">last but not least.  ok what story is this trying to tell me?  the skull, the pine cone, the bird.  not sure.  interesting mix though.  ice cubes?  at least the appearance of.  not crazy about the material it''s sitting on.  6</td>', 'last but not least.  ok what story is this trying to tell me?  the skull, the pine cone, the bird.  not sure.  interesting mix though.  ice cubes?  at least the appearance of.  not crazy about the material it''s sitting on.  6', '2010-08-21 09:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136681, 903682, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting modern take and an aesthetically pleasing composition.  The mono conversion could do with some work, in particular there are no true whites.  Your choice of lighting has led to a rather flat image.  Over all, an image with some real potential, but a bit more attention to lighting and mono conversion needed to make it fully successful.</td>', 'Interesting modern take and an aesthetically pleasing composition.  The mono conversion could do with some work, in particular there are no true whites.  Your choice of lighting has led to a rather flat image.  Over all, an image with some real potential, but a bit more attention to lighting and mono conversion needed to make it fully successful.', '2010-08-21 10:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136684, 903412, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very different take on the challenge, and it works! Mono conversion is good. I really like this!</td>', 'A very different take on the challenge, and it works! Mono conversion is good. I really like this!', '2010-08-21 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136685, 903524, 67258, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a case where the negative space and non-frame filling composition work - unusually for a still life.  I particularly like the way the shelf forms a natural border.  Mono conversion is very good, with a superb range of tones, whilst remaining firmly low key.</td>', 'This seems to be a case where the negative space and non-frame filling composition work - unusually for a still life.  I particularly like the way the shelf forms a natural border.  Mono conversion is very good, with a superb range of tones, whilst remaining firmly low key.', '2010-08-21 10:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136688, 903427, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you have gone for such a black background and foreground - it gives a rathe strange appearance of floating - particularly of the central apple which appears to have had a bite taken out of the bottom.  Mono conversion is good - your choice of channels intrigues me as the pear has come out so much lighter that the grapes and apple.  Just out of interest are they waxed plastic fruit?</td>', 'I''m not sure why you have gone for such a black background and foreground - it gives a rathe strange appearance of floating - particularly of the central apple which appears to have had a bite taken out of the bottom.  Mono conversion is good - your choice of channels intrigues me as the pear has come out so much lighter that the grapes and apple.  Just out of interest are they waxed plastic fruit?', '2010-08-21 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136689, 903486, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition - really, very good.</td>', 'Super composition - really, very good.', '2010-08-21 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136691, 903388, 67258, '<td valign="top">The glass is a little too obvious, and I am not keen on the steel fitment that runs across the back.  While the bottles are intrinsically interesting, there placement of  doesn''t really lend itself to a strong still life photograph.</td>', 'The glass is a little too obvious, and I am not keen on the steel fitment that runs across the back.  While the bottles are intrinsically interesting, there placement of  doesn''t really lend itself to a strong still life photograph.', '2010-08-21 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136692, 903030, 67258, '<td valign="top">Blue cheese and wine I would go for, but the grapes also look as though they are a bit on the mouldy side!  If you repeat this exercise, pay a little moe attention to the folds of your background cloth - the way they are placed at the moment makes me think of a silk-lined coffin!  Perhaps having the background cloth a little further from the subject may help?</td>', 'Blue cheese and wine I would go for, but the grapes also look as though they are a bit on the mouldy side!  If you repeat this exercise, pay a little moe attention to the folds of your background cloth - the way they are placed at the moment makes me think of a silk-lined coffin!  Perhaps having the background cloth a little further from the subject may help?', '2010-08-21 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136695, 902736, 67258, '<td valign="top">Best I have seen so far - lighting is good!</td>', 'Best I have seen so far - lighting is good!', '2010-08-21 10:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136697, 903200, 67258, '<td valign="top">A photo with this degree of simplicity does, I feel, need critical sharpness throughout for it to succeed.  Here, although you have shown some texture in the egg, the corkscrew is quite soft.</td>', 'A photo with this degree of simplicity does, I feel, need critical sharpness throughout for it to succeed.  Here, although you have shown some texture in the egg, the corkscrew is quite soft.', '2010-08-21 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136761, 903358, 61396, '<td valign="top">The leader is fun.</td>', 'The leader is fun.', '2010-08-21 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136780, 903723, 62989, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture - the structure and tonws and textures work really well - I am only giving it a 6 because I am not sure it is a still life - nice mysterious picture though</td>', 'I really like this picture - the structure and tonws and textures work really well - I am only giving it a 6 because I am not sure it is a still life - nice mysterious picture though', '2010-08-21 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136781, 903498, 62989, '<td valign="top">Very puzzling, somewhat disturbing - a 6 because it kept me looking so long and made me comment - up to an 8 now</td>', 'Very puzzling, somewhat disturbing - a 6 because it kept me looking so long and made me comment - up to an 8 now', '2010-08-21 12:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136782, 903579, 62989, '<td valign="top">One of the best of th conventional still lifes</td>', 'One of the best of th conventional still lifes', '2010-08-21 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136785, 903687, 62989, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the convemntional subject matter entries</td>', 'One of the best of the convemntional subject matter entries', '2010-08-21 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136816, 903623, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, lots of detail.</td>', 'Very nice, lots of detail.', '2010-08-21 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136817, 903040, 43774, '<td valign="top">A nice setup.</td>', 'A nice setup.', '2010-08-21 13:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136818, 902736, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture on the wall, ncie setup.</td>', 'Lovely texture on the wall, ncie setup.', '2010-08-21 13:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136819, 903496, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice shape and lighting.</td>', 'Nice shape and lighting.', '2010-08-21 13:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136820, 903453, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, a fresh bright image, lovely!</td>', 'Very nice, a fresh bright image, lovely!', '2010-08-21 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136821, 903462, 43774, '<td valign="top">A nice setup but a bit too overprocessed for my tastes. By that I mean too sharp and the glare from the lights is annoying.</td>', 'A nice setup but a bit too overprocessed for my tastes. By that I mean too sharp and the glare from the lights is annoying.', '2010-08-21 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136822, 903700, 43774, '<td valign="top">Simple but well done.</td>', 'Simple but well done.', '2010-08-21 13:41:43.000000', NULL, 1);
