(6136829, 903517, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice setup but the background is too black......it gives the items a cut and paste feel. But still not a bad photo.</td>', 'Nice setup but the background is too black......it gives the items a cut and paste feel. But still not a bad photo.', '2010-08-21 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
