(6137242, 903687, 104841, '<td valign="top">while i like the subject matter and mono conversion you have done, I think you needed to consider the position of the window frame in the shot. In my view where it is right now is detracting from the shape of the instrument.</td>', 'while i like the subject matter and mono conversion you have done, I think you needed to consider the position of the window frame in the shot. In my view where it is right now is detracting from the shape of the instrument.', '2010-08-22 04:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
