(6137320, 903398, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2010-08-22 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137437, 902736, 89457, '<td valign="top">I looked at all of the entries and this one is sooo what you would expect to see when you hear the words still life, but that is not why I think it is probably the best. I like, over all of the rest, the use of dark and white spaces. I like the extreme contrasts balanced in both larger and smaller areas. Good eye.</td>', 'I looked at all of the entries and this one is sooo what you would expect to see when you hear the words still life, but that is not why I think it is probably the best. I like, over all of the rest, the use of dark and white spaces. I like the extreme contrasts balanced in both larger and smaller areas. Good eye.', '2010-08-22 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137457, 903621, 100831, '<td valign="top">A classic.</td>', 'A classic.', '2010-08-22 13:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137458, 903577, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m liking everything (a lot) except the border, which I feel draws the eye out of the frame instead of drawing you in.</td>', 'I''m liking everything (a lot) except the border, which I feel draws the eye out of the frame instead of drawing you in.', '2010-08-22 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137459, 903263, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ll start this off by saying: I''m not much of a still life fan. <br/> <br/>I gave this on a 7. I thought your lighting was very good -- I like the more contrasty still lifes, and this one falls into that category. The watering can is wonderful. I like the highlights and the details on the handles &amp; spout. The rest of the shot doesn''t interesting me as much. The rest of the tools are appropriate, but not very visually interesting. <br/> <br/>The one thing I''m not crazy about is the round table. I find the front of the table distracting, it catches the eye, but I don''t think it adds to the picture. (small nit -- it wouldn''t change my voting.)<br/> <br/>The watering can was so wonderful, that if you had done something simpler with the can and maybe one or two antique interesting gardening items, it would have been an 8 or 9.</td>', 'I''ll start this off by saying: I''m not much of a still life fan.  I gave this on a 7. I thought your lighting was very good -- I like the more contrasty still lifes, and this one falls into that category. The watering can is wonderful. I like the highlights and the details on the handles & spout. The rest of the shot doesn''t interesting me as much. The rest of the tools are appropriate, but not very visually interesting.  The one thing I''m not crazy about is the round table. I find the front of the table distracting, it catches the eye, but I don''t think it adds to the picture. (small nit -- it wouldn''t change my voting.) The watering can was so wonderful, that if you had done something simpler with the can and maybe one or two antique interesting gardening items, it would have been an 8 or 9.', '2010-08-22 13:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137460, 903524, 89457, '<td valign="top">Art is a very relative thing. It is a testament to point of view. I, myself, think that there might have been a bit more contrast between highlights and shadows blended between larger spaces and smaller in the composition of the image. Good effort.</td>', 'Art is a very relative thing. It is a testament to point of view. I, myself, think that there might have been a bit more contrast between highlights and shadows blended between larger spaces and smaller in the composition of the image. Good effort.', '2010-08-22 13:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137461, 903453, 100831, '<td valign="top">What a nice high key bright cheerful day to wake up to:)</td>', 'What a nice high key bright cheerful day to wake up to:)', '2010-08-22 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137462, 903317, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of elements and well composed. I like the brick background too.</td>', 'Nice combination of elements and well composed. I like the brick background too.', '2010-08-22 13:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137463, 903254, 100831, '<td valign="top">lovely dof and shadow play.</td>', 'lovely dof and shadow play.', '2010-08-22 13:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137466, 902926, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together... and I''m a sucker for anything that has to do with music.</td>', 'Nicely put together... and I''m a sucker for anything that has to do with music.', '2010-08-22 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137467, 903789, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns in there. Great symmetry.</td>', 'Interesting patterns in there. Great symmetry.', '2010-08-22 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137475, 903787, 89457, '<td valign="top">I am wondering if the upper corner highlights had been either down lowere or removed all together. They are where my eye went as soon as I saw the picture. Good job though.</td>', 'I am wondering if the upper corner highlights had been either down lowere or removed all together. They are where my eye went as soon as I saw the picture. Good job though.', '2010-08-22 13:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137478, 903601, 97774, '<td valign="top">one of the best imo. The lighting and contrast are great. I hope you do well.</td>', 'one of the best imo. The lighting and contrast are great. I hope you do well.', '2010-08-22 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137480, 903688, 89457, '<td valign="top">Great use of big and small highlights arranged in a very appealing composition.</td>', 'Great use of big and small highlights arranged in a very appealing composition.', '2010-08-22 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137484, 903436, 100831, '<td valign="top">You captured the wonderful glow. And with such rich tones. Great job!</td>', 'You captured the wonderful glow. And with such rich tones. Great job!', '2010-08-22 13:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137485, 903049, 100831, '<td valign="top">Looks like Beethoven. But it doesn''t matter - love the subject and the picture!</td>', 'Looks like Beethoven. But it doesn''t matter - love the subject and the picture!', '2010-08-22 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137486, 903228, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely shadows.</td>', 'Lovely shadows.', '2010-08-22 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137487, 903465, 89457, '<td valign="top">Clever use of light. I like the solid light off of the facing flowers and the translucent light through the turned ones.</td>', 'Clever use of light. I like the solid light off of the facing flowers and the translucent light through the turned ones.', '2010-08-22 13:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137491, 903534, 89457, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and dark in all the right places.</td>', 'Great use of light and dark in all the right places.', '2010-08-22 13:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137501, 903575, 89457, '<td valign="top">I like the order and chaos in this shot, although it is a simple definition of contrast, symmetry and asymmetry.</td>', 'I like the order and chaos in this shot, although it is a simple definition of contrast, symmetry and asymmetry.', '2010-08-22 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137507, 903519, 89457, '<td valign="top">Art is relative. I would have preferred a mix up of highlights and shadows with at least some midtones. A little too bit mappish. That is just me though.</td>', 'Art is relative. I would have preferred a mix up of highlights and shadows with at least some midtones. A little too bit mappish. That is just me though.', '2010-08-22 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137508, 903172, 89457, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and the opposite placements of the shakers and the pooch.</td>', 'I like the lines and the opposite placements of the shakers and the pooch.', '2010-08-22 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137510, 903791, 89457, '<td valign="top">Good job of separating what would be seen as close lightnesses.I love calla lilies so you get points for that too.  :- )</td>', 'Good job of separating what would be seen as close lightnesses.I love calla lilies so you get points for that too.  :- )', '2010-08-22 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137513, 903779, 112635, '<td valign="top">with the salmonella scare right now, I won''t be trying an omelet in weeks. On to the critique: the gradient you created in the background is a nice touch, spot on sharpness</td>', 'with the salmonella scare right now, I won''t be trying an omelet in weeks. On to the critique: the gradient you created in the background is a nice touch, spot on sharpness', '2010-08-22 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
