(6137528, 903718, 112635, '<td valign="top">nice collection! perhaps a light-box, even a DIY one, would provide softer lighting for these guys</td>', 'nice collection! perhaps a light-box, even a DIY one, would provide softer lighting for these guys', '2010-08-22 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
