(6138801, 903601, 17507, '<td valign="top">Another very fine piece of work from you. I''m always impressed by your individual images as they go by, as well as your consistently high level of performance. <br/> <br/>What struck me most about this photo during voting was the shape of the light on the background. How did you do that? I''m guessing some kind of custom hood for a strobe, but it''s only a guess. I hope I''m not asking a magician to tell me how she does her tricks... :)</td>', 'Another very fine piece of work from you. I''m always impressed by your individual images as they go by, as well as your consistently high level of performance.  What struck me most about this photo during voting was the shape of the light on the background. How did you do that? I''m guessing some kind of custom hood for a strobe, but it''s only a guess. I hope I''m not asking a magician to tell me how she does her tricks... :)', '2010-08-23 15:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
