(6139089, 903227, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this.   How long did it take you?<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon and a beautiful image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. <br/> <br/>It took me about 20 minutes to put all the pins in, and about 5 minutes to set up the light tent to get the best shadows. In hindsight, I should have put the light tent up first, to ensure the pear didn''t get too brown, but I had intended this pear as a trial only. But, after putting the time in, I decided to shoot this one right away.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I really like this.   How long did it take you? Congrats on your ribbon and a beautiful image.   Thanks.  It took me about 20 minutes to put all the pins in, and about 5 minutes to set up the light tent to get the best shadows. In hindsight, I should have put the light tent up first, to ensure the pear didn''t get too brown, but I had intended this pear as a trial only. But, after putting the time in, I decided to shoot this one right away.', '2010-08-23 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
